[I] A GTK greeter for LightDM

[T] LightDM GTK Greeter is a greeter for the LightDM cross-desktop display
[T] manager with moderate requirements, based on GTK. It lets users pick
[T] their account and session and authenticate, and is configurable in its
[T] appearance.

